        "marks": 6,
        "model": "Ultra Heat Treatment (UHT) / Sterilisation:\nProcess: UHT. Temperature: 132–140°C. Time: 1–4 seconds. Effect: All bacteria and spores destroyed; milk is commercially sterile; long shelf life (6–9 months unopened) without refrigeration; slight change in flavour; significant loss of vitamins B1 (thiamine), B2, and C.\n\nPasteurisation (for comparison): Temperature: 72°C. Time: 15–25 seconds. Effect: Pathogenic bacteria destroyed; short shelf life (refrigerated); minor loss of thiamine and vitamin C.",
